data hetzner_object_storage_included_quota_note: String = "What the Hetzner Object Storage page DOES state in fetched text, and the only quota fact stored from it: 'This base price includes 1 TB of storage (up to 744 TB-hours) and 1 TB of egress traffic.' The 744 TB-hours figure is itself the 31-day month, a third billing-period convention beside AWS's GB-Mo and Google's gibibyte-hour."

